@Chakra.API_HostAddress = http://localhost:5277

# Isi token JWT Supabase dan id dari response sebelumnya
@adminToken = <jwt admin>
@userToken = <jwt user biasa>
@userId = <guid user pemilik premi>
@premiId = <guid premi>
@installmentId = <guid cicilan>
@otherPremiId = <guid premi milik user lain>
@otherInstallmentId = <guid cicilan milik user lain>

### 1. Admin buat premi: 12.000.000 / 7, cicilan 1 jatuh tempo 15 Jan 2027
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 12000000,
  "tenor": 7,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 1b. Jadwal cicilan (1-6 = 1.714.285, 7 = 1.714.290)
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/installments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 2. DueDay 31: harus 31 Jan, 28 Feb, 31 Mar 2027
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 300000,
  "tenor": 3,
  "dueDay": 31,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-31"
}

### 3a. Total lebih kecil dari tenor -> 400
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 5,
  "tenor": 12,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 3b. Total bukan rupiah bulat -> 400
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "{{userId}}",
  "totalAmount": 1000000.50,
  "tenor": 12,
  "dueDay": 15,
  "gracePeriodDays": 7,
  "startDate": "2027-01-15"
}

### 4-7. Bayar cicilan (urutan, bayar ulang, sampai lunas)
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 7. Detail premi: Status, RemainingAmount, NextDueDate
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 8-9. Cancel premi
PATCH {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 10. User biasa bayar -> 403
POST {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{installmentId}}/pay
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 10b. User biasa cancel -> 403
PATCH {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{premiId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 11. User biasa: hanya premi miliknya
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12. User biasa: premi orang lain -> 404
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi/{{otherPremiId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 12b. User biasa: cicilan orang lain -> 404
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/installments/{{otherInstallmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 13. Tanpa token -> 401
GET {{Chakra.API_HostAddress}}/api/premi
